# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored.

# Where the Find Us / Contact form posts. Create a form at formspree.io and
# paste its endpoint here — it looks like https://formspree.io/f/xxxxabcd
#
# While this is unset the form deliberately sends nothing and tells the visitor
# to email chambers instead, so that enquiries are never transmitted to an
# endpoint the firm does not control. Anything set here is public: it is
# compiled into the client bundle, as any browser-submitted form endpoint must
# be. Never put a secret in a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=
